{"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "035E", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\nu^{-1}(\\Spec(A))$", "MATH_0002": "$A$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{properties-definition-nagata}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{lemma-description-normalization}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:6b091a36e227a6d80f559001812b368d8c7d792ef8db207cde05e63e1804580b", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:f9394a40984733a7a689d404c8976de23fd2a8e2b1813c01ecebf43c6bff96b6", "source_text": "Follows from the definition\n(Properties, Definition <REF_0001>) and\nLemma <REF_0002>. Namely, in this case\nthe lemma says that <MATH_0001> is the spectrum\nof the integral closure of <MATH_0002> in its field of fractions.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:240a621baae33482695f8a3e30724b756539fad18c4b0f855e2d956f7d11011f", "unit_id": "tag:035R:proof"}
